@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome

' ============ 参与者 ============
actor "读者\n(Reader)" as Reader
actor "学生读者\n(Student)" as Student
actor "教师读者\n(Teacher)" as Teacher
actor "图书管理员\n(Librarian)" as Librarian
actor "系统管理员\n(SystemAdmin)" as SystemAdmin
actor "系统\n(System)" as System

' ============ 泛化关系：学生读者、教师读者泛化自读者 ============
Reader <|-- Student
Reader <|-- Teacher

' ============ 用例定义 ============
usecase "注册读者账号" as UC01
usecase "办理借阅证" as UC02
usecase "删除借阅证" as UC03
usecase "添加图书管理员" as UC04
usecase "删除图书管理员" as UC05
usecase "添加图书标题信息" as UC06
usecase "删除图书标题信息" as UC07
usecase "添加馆藏副本" as UC08
usecase "删除馆藏副本" as UC09
usecase "查询图书" as UC10
usecase "办理借书" as UC11
usecase "办理还书" as UC12
usecase "查询借阅信息" as UC13
usecase "预约图书" as UC14
usecase "计算超期罚款" as UC15
usecase "维护借阅规则和罚款规则" as UC16
usecase "续借图书" as UC17
usecase "标记罚款已缴" as UC18

' ============ 读者用例（直接操作） ============
Reader --> UC10
Reader --> UC13
Reader --> UC14

' ============ 图书管理员用例 ============
Librarian --> UC01
Librarian --> UC02
Librarian --> UC03
Librarian --> UC06
Librarian --> UC07
Librarian --> UC08
Librarian --> UC09
Librarian --> UC10
Librarian --> UC11
Librarian --> UC12
Librarian --> UC13
Librarian --> UC14
Librarian --> UC16
Librarian --> UC17
Librarian --> UC18

' ============ 系统管理员用例 ============
SystemAdmin --> UC04
SystemAdmin --> UC05

' ============ 系统（自动）用例 ============
System --> UC15

' ============ include 关系：办理还书包含计算超期罚款 ============
UC12 ..> UC15 : <<include>>

@enduml